    summary: "Proverbs 9:10 says the fear of the Lord is the beginning of wisdom. Ecclesiastes 12:13-14 concludes that the whole duty of man is to fear God and keep his commandments. Psalm 111:10, Proverbs 3:7 and Isaiah 11:2-3 add that fear is joined with humility and the Spirit of wisdom. This lesson explains reverent fear, its difference from terror, and how it guides decisions.",
    scripture: ["Proverbs 9:10", "Ecclesiastes 12:13-14"], more: ["Psalm 111:10", "Proverbs 3:7", "Genesis 39:9"], memory: "Proverbs 9:10",
