    sa: ["How should believers pray about decisions?", ["trust", "acknowledge", "surrender", "thanks", "peace", "wisdom"], "A good answer says believers pray before, during and after decisions, trusting and acknowledging God, surrendering their will, giving thanks, asking for wisdom and testing feelings of peace by other guidance."],
